295
00:18:54,490 --> 00:18:55,440
Same thing down here.

296
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:57,700
The equations look a
little bit different.

297
00:18:57,700 --> 00:18:58,912
But it's the same idea.

298
00:18:58,912 --> 00:19:00,870
You figure out what are
the constraints imposed

299
00:19:00,870 --> 00:19:02,520
