303
00:19:09,270 --> 00:19:10,115
that went into it.

304
00:19:10,115 --> 00:19:11,490
Figure out all
those constraints,

305
00:19:11,490 --> 00:19:15,060
reduce them to polynomials,
and then manipulate them

306
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:17,250
