00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:37,850
Yeah.

355
00:21:37,850 --> 00:21:38,725
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

356
00:21:38,725 --> 00:21:41,630
DENNIS FREEMAN: Not continuous.

357
00:21:41,630 --> 00:21:43,988
That's also true.

358
00:21:43,988 --> 00:21:44,906
Yes.

359
00:21:44,906 --> 00:21:47,172
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

