00:21:47,172 --> 00:21:48,880
DENNIS FREEMAN: The
integral is always 0.

361
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:51,860
That's a problem.

362
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:57,700
So it's just not going to
be a very useful signal.

363
00:21:57,700 --> 00:21:58,880
OK, what am I doing?

364
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:02,440
I'm trying to figure out
a basis signal that I

365
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,640
