376
00:22:33,010 --> 00:22:34,480
Everyone see that?

377
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:36,970
That's a problem.

378
00:22:36,970 --> 00:22:39,820
This is the problem in CT.

379
00:22:39,820 --> 00:22:42,840
If you guys figure out the
