380
00:22:42,840 --> 00:22:44,800
CT's easy.

381
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:52,250
So what we do is think
about defining a signal that

382
00:22:52,250 --> 00:22:55,580
would have the property
that it behaved as though it

383
00:22:55,580 --> 00:22:57,377
