417
00:24:36,100 --> 00:24:43,440
It should be 0 almost everywhere
and the integral should be 1.

418
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:46,110
So there is no such thing.

419
00:24:46,110 --> 00:24:48,125
This is an idealized signal.

420
00:24:48,125 --> 00:24:50,250
This is something that we
think about in the limit.

421
00:24:50,250 --> 00:24:52,740
It turns out that we
can get a lot of insight

422
00:24:52,740 --> 00:24:55,650
