00:25:33,175 --> 00:25:35,770
And that will be something
that we spend a lot of time on,

439
00:25:35,770 --> 00:25:40,060
because that decomposition
is not trivial.

440
00:25:40,060 --> 00:25:42,700
But it is possible.

441
00:25:42,700 --> 00:25:46,720
So the question was, can we
decompose arbitrary signals

442
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:48,220
